    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d312">

                <pb facs="0449" n="375" sameAs="frus:frus1866p2/pg375"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Kilpatrick.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 4]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1866-02-19"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 19, 1866</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> By direction of the President of the United
                    States, I have to inform you of the revocation by him, on the 12th instant, of
                    the exequatur granted to Don Esteban Rogers on the 14th October, 1863,
                    authorizing him to exercise the functions of consul <hi rendition="#italic">ad
                        interim</hi> of the republic of Chili for the port of New York and its
                    dependencies.</p>
                <p>You are instructed to communicate this information to the ministers of foreign
                    affairs of Chili, and to say that this measure was adopted for causes
                    satisfactory to this government, and in defence of the dignity and honor of the
                    United States. You will add, at the same time, that should the Chilian
                    government see fit to appoint a successor to Mr. Rogers, if entirely
                    unobjectionable, the usual exequatur will be granted to him.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Judson Kilpatrick,</hi> Esq., &amp;<hi
                            rendition="#italic">c</hi>., &amp;<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>.,
                            &amp;<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
